WEBVTT

00:00:28.940 --> 00:00:31.280
Do you insist on going, Father?

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:34.490
Are you going to stop me, Sesshomaru?

00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:37.950
I won't try to stop you.

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:40.450
However, before you go...

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:44.790
please entrust the swords,
Sounga and Tetsusaiga, to me.

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:48.960
And if I say I won't,

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:51.010
will you kill me, your own father?

00:00:57.050 --> 00:00:59.220
Do you desire power so much?

00:01:01.310 --> 00:01:03.690
Why do you seek power?

00:01:04.810 --> 00:01:07.610
The path I walk is
the Way of Supreme Conquest.

00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:10.780
And it is power that will
reveal the way for me.

00:01:12.320 --> 00:01:14.030
The Way of Supreme Conquest, huh?

00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:16.780
Tell me, Sesshomaru...

00:01:16.780 --> 00:01:19.830
Have you someone to protect?

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:23.040
Someone to protect?

00:01:29.090 --> 00:01:34.090
I, Sesshomaru,
have no need of such.

00:02:12.380 --> 00:02:14.130
Please wait, Lord Takemaru!

00:02:14.210 --> 00:02:16.590
The Princess is in labor!

00:02:16.720 --> 00:02:19.550
She is going to have a child
fathered by a demon!

00:02:19.550 --> 00:02:21.300
There is no need
for decorum!

00:02:21.720 --> 00:02:24.100
A man must not enter!

00:02:24.930 --> 00:02:26.390
Lord Takemaru. . .?

00:02:36.690 --> 00:02:37.950
Dearest...

00:02:42.990 --> 00:02:45.750
<i>Have you someone to protect?</i>

00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:50.960
Ridiculous!

00:02:56.090 --> 00:02:58.260
You must not do this!
Do not be rash!

00:02:58.420 --> 00:03:00.430
Please reconsider!

00:03:00.430 --> 00:03:05.770
The wounds from your battle
with Ryukotsusei have not healed!

00:03:06.310 --> 00:03:08.600
I cannot let her die!

00:03:08.770 --> 00:03:11.060
- But...!
- Besides...

00:03:11.230 --> 00:03:13.150
I am not long for this world.

00:03:13.270 --> 00:03:14.690
Master!

00:03:25.160 --> 00:03:26.910
A lunar eclipse...

00:03:27.370 --> 00:03:30.210
A perfect night to
slay a demon.

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:37.300
Who is it?

00:03:37.630 --> 00:03:40.170
It is I, Takemaru of Setsuna.

00:03:41.090 --> 00:03:42.510
Takemaru?

00:03:43.720 --> 00:03:45.470
Thank goodness
you are here.

00:03:45.970 --> 00:03:50.560
Gather the men outside
and leave immediately.

00:03:50.850 --> 00:03:54.980
There is no one
who can defy him.

00:03:55.310 --> 00:04:01.990
My Lady Izayoi, I have long felt
a deep attachment towards you.

00:04:02.530 --> 00:04:07.120
Even if your heart has been
captured by a demon...!

00:04:20.380 --> 00:04:23.300
<i>My feelings for you
will never change.</i>

00:04:32.350 --> 00:04:35.190
<i>Izayoi! I am coming!</i>

00:04:58.460 --> 00:05:02.050
Wind Scar!

00:05:26.990 --> 00:05:29.240
Izayoi! Izayoi!

00:05:31.240 --> 00:05:35.460
So you've come, demon!
A little late, though.

00:05:35.790 --> 00:05:36.870
What?

00:05:36.870 --> 00:05:40.210
Lady Izayoi is in
a place beyond your reach.

00:05:40.590 --> 00:05:42.460
I sent her there myself.

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:44.260
Fool!

00:05:56.770 --> 00:05:58.270
Set it afire!

00:05:58.270 --> 00:06:00.610
Burn down this mansion...

00:06:00.610 --> 00:06:02.440
along with its occupants
and the demon!

00:06:17.420 --> 00:06:18.290
Izayoi

00:06:19.500 --> 00:06:20.630
Izayoi

00:06:30.140 --> 00:06:32.310
I'm counting on you, Tenseiga!

00:07:00.630 --> 00:07:03.500
I have no regrets since
I am fighting you.

00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:06.510
Let us journey together
to the netherworld!

00:07:08.510 --> 00:07:10.010
Live!

00:07:10.430 --> 00:07:11.640
My dear...!

00:07:18.270 --> 00:07:19.480
Inuyasha.

00:07:20.690 --> 00:07:21.810
What?

00:07:21.810 --> 00:07:26.730
The infant's name.
The infant shall be named Inuyasha.

00:07:28.320 --> 00:07:29.570
Inuyasha?

00:07:30.450 --> 00:07:32.160
Now go!

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:34.330
Yes!

00:07:50.680 --> 00:07:52.010
<i>Izayoi...</i>

00:07:52.050 --> 00:07:55.390
<i>You must live. Live long.</i>

00:07:56.390 --> 00:07:59.180
<i>Together with Inuyasha.</i>

00:08:08.730 --> 00:08:12.950
SWORDS OF AN HONORABLE RULER

00:08:26.540 --> 00:08:28.880
<i>My name is Kagome Higurashi.</i>

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:32.090
<i>I was your average middle-schooler,</i>

00:08:32.090 --> 00:08:35.050
<i>until one day, I fell into an ancient well
in our family shrine</i>

00:08:35.050 --> 00:08:36.050
What took you so long?
I've been starving!

00:08:36.050 --> 00:08:37.680
<i>And passed through time
into the feudal era.</i>

00:08:38.680 --> 00:08:41.560
<i>There, I met a half-demon named Inuyasha</i>

00:08:41.560 --> 00:08:43.940
<i>who is part demon and part human.</i>

00:08:43.940 --> 00:08:45.520
Got anything better?

00:08:45.520 --> 00:08:47.360
<i>He's so moody and spoiled,
but oh, so strong!</i>

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:47.610
- Hey, I went to a lot of trouble!
- All I'm saying is...

00:08:49.070 --> 00:08:52.780
<i>Inuyasha has a demon brother
named Sesshomaru</i>

00:08:52.780 --> 00:08:56.950
<i>who covets the Tetsusaiga,
a sword passed down from their father.</i>

00:08:58.200 --> 00:09:01.410
<i>Even though he already
has a sword, the Tenseiga.</i>

00:09:01.580 --> 00:09:03.960
I said, I'll protect you!

00:09:12.880 --> 00:09:15.340
<i>Presently, our group includes
Miroku, a monk who has a Wind Tunnel</i>

00:09:15.340 --> 00:09:16.390
Wait for me!

00:09:16.390 --> 00:09:17.340
<i>In his palm which swallows up anything.</i>

00:09:17.340 --> 00:09:18.640
Hey, Inuyasha!

00:09:18.640 --> 00:09:19.140
<i>And Sango the Demon Slayer.</i>

00:09:19.760 --> 00:09:23.270
<i>Along with Shippo,
the young fox-demon,</i>

00:09:23.270 --> 00:09:26.100
<i>we journey in search of
the Shikon Jewel shards.</i>

00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:27.520
Inuyasha!

00:09:28.150 --> 00:09:30.940
<i>At first, it was hard living
in the feudal era,</i>

00:09:30.940 --> 00:09:32.610
<i>but I've grown accustomed to it</i>

00:09:32.610 --> 00:09:36.070
<i>and through great teamwork,
I'm managing fine.</i>

00:09:36.070 --> 00:09:36.700
- You lecherous monk!
- But Sango...

00:09:36.700 --> 00:09:37.200
Sit, boy!

00:09:41.200 --> 00:09:45.160
<i>And besides, I get to return to
the present time once in a while like this.</i>

00:09:55.170 --> 00:09:56.340
There it comes!

00:09:58.340 --> 00:09:59.180
Kagome!

00:09:59.680 --> 00:10:00.430
Okay!

00:10:01.470 --> 00:10:02.100
Go!

00:10:02.350 --> 00:10:03.020
Yuka!

00:10:03.430 --> 00:10:04.180
Ru get it!

00:10:06.270 --> 00:10:07.390
Watch it, Kagome!

00:10:12.690 --> 00:10:14.490
Hey! Where's the ball?!

00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:17.110
Did someone just call you, Kagome?

00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:19.660
Didn't something
just pass us by?

00:10:21.030 --> 00:10:25.040
Yeah! Just try and hurt Kagome
with somethin' like this!

00:10:26.540 --> 00:10:27.710
He)', Kagome!

00:10:28.370 --> 00:10:29.750
Over here! Hey!

00:10:30.330 --> 00:10:31.130
Sit!

00:10:32.710 --> 00:10:34.380
What's wrong, Kagome?

00:10:35.380 --> 00:10:37.420
What did you mean by "sit"?

00:10:37.680 --> 00:10:38.970
Oh...

00:10:39.090 --> 00:10:41.050
Did I say that?

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:42.930
You sure did!

00:10:43.390 --> 00:10:44.180
Yeah...

00:10:44.720 --> 00:10:47.890
Oh... I meant vinegar is good.

00:10:47.890 --> 00:10:48.890
Vinegar?

00:10:48.890 --> 00:10:50.900
You know vinegar is
good for you, right?

00:10:51.150 --> 00:10:54.690
Grandpa always tells me to sip vinegar
'cause it's good for your health.

00:10:55.110 --> 00:10:56.740
But. .

00:10:56.900 --> 00:10:59.240
I think I drank too much
and now I have a tummy-ache.

00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:01.320
- 'Scuse me, okay?
- Are you all right?

00:11:08.580 --> 00:11:09.540
I'm home.

00:11:09.670 --> 00:11:11.130
Welcome back, Sota.

00:11:11.210 --> 00:11:12.420
What's that?

00:11:12.420 --> 00:11:13.750
Oh that...

00:11:14.590 --> 00:11:15.590
A family shrine treasure,

00:11:15.590 --> 00:11:17.170
a sword passed down
from generation to generation

00:11:17.170 --> 00:11:18.760
known as the Sword of Murakumo.

00:11:19.590 --> 00:11:20.630
That's what it is.

00:11:21.050 --> 00:11:22.640
Oh...

00:11:23.220 --> 00:11:25.180
The Sword of Murakumo is

00:11:25.180 --> 00:11:26.970
the alternate name for
the Sword of Kusanagi

00:11:26.970 --> 00:11:28.890
which appears in the annals of
the Ancient Records and Chronicle of Japan.

00:11:29.140 --> 00:11:32.310
In other words,
it is a national treasure.

00:11:33.360 --> 00:11:36.940
Geez! Why'd you
come to my school?!

00:11:37.110 --> 00:11:39.280
I didn't want anything
to happen to you.

00:11:40.450 --> 00:11:44.450
I have to watch out for you
since you always get into scrapes.

00:11:44.580 --> 00:11:47.370
This time period isn't
as dangerous as yours.

00:11:48.330 --> 00:11:50.920
Grrr...

00:11:59.010 --> 00:12:01.430
I was just playing volleyball.
It's a sport.

00:12:01.840 --> 00:12:03.890
Rather, it's like exercise.

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:07.640
Exercise?
Is it a game like kemari?

00:12:08.020 --> 00:12:09.640
Yes, that's precisely it!

00:12:09.730 --> 00:12:11.310
Have you ever played?

00:12:13.810 --> 00:12:16.570
I don't have nice memories
about it.

00:12:44.800 --> 00:12:47.810
<i>That was the time I saw
my mother's tears.</i>

00:12:50.810 --> 00:12:51.560
Inuyasha?

00:12:52.640 --> 00:12:54.310
- What?
- ls something wrong?

00:12:54.850 --> 00:12:56.310
No, it's nothing.

00:12:58.110 --> 00:13:01.570
By the way, can't you do something
about the Beads of Subjugation?

00:13:01.780 --> 00:13:05.200
If you keep telling me to "sit,"
my body won't hold up.

00:13:05.610 --> 00:13:08.580
Do I say "sit" that often. . .?

00:13:09.580 --> 00:13:11.700
Oops, sorry!
I didn't mean that.

00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:13.040
It's too late!

00:13:20.550 --> 00:13:23.470
This is the grave of
Inuyasha's mother?

00:13:23.670 --> 00:13:27.550
IZAYOI

00:13:27.550 --> 00:13:27.890
She was very beautiful.

00:13:29.010 --> 00:13:33.310
It's been many years since
Lady Izayoi passed away.

00:13:33.930 --> 00:13:36.350
But Master Inuyasha still misses her.

00:13:37.190 --> 00:13:39.360
Did you place
those flowers there, Myoga'?

00:13:39.480 --> 00:13:42.280
Oh no...
It was probably Master Inuyasha.

00:13:42.400 --> 00:13:45.860
So there is a kind side of him.

00:13:45.990 --> 00:13:49.240
Yes...
He is half-human.

00:13:49.240 --> 00:13:53.250
He can't help but have some traits
that are unbecoming of demons.

00:13:54.870 --> 00:13:57.330
So being kind is not a good thing?

00:13:59.630 --> 00:14:00.750
There!

00:14:04.380 --> 00:14:08.590
Now then, the Sword of Murakumo
is the magical sword

00:14:08.590 --> 00:14:12.140
that Prince Susano-Oh
found inside

00:14:12.140 --> 00:14:16.730
<i>the beast, Yamata no Orochi,
which he slew.</i>

00:14:18.060 --> 00:14:21.150
And we take it out once in a while
and give it an airing.

00:14:21.150 --> 00:14:23.900
But there is rust on this sword

00:14:23.900 --> 00:14:26.070
and I can't remove it
from its sheathe.

00:14:27.070 --> 00:14:28.530
There!

00:14:28.610 --> 00:14:30.120
I've made space for it here.

00:14:30.410 --> 00:14:32.200
There's something written on this.

00:14:32.620 --> 00:14:35.870
It says Sword of Murakumo.

00:14:36.120 --> 00:14:39.120
But doesn't this last character
mean "fang"?

00:14:39.460 --> 00:14:40.580
What?!

00:14:40.830 --> 00:14:43.590
Then it must be read Sounga.

00:14:43.670 --> 00:14:45.960
Hah! So it's a fake!

00:14:46.090 --> 00:14:47.800
No, that's impossible!

00:14:48.180 --> 00:14:50.390
This is a sword of true value,

00:14:50.390 --> 00:14:52.640
found by our forefather's forefather
generations ago

00:14:52.640 --> 00:14:54.770
in the ancient well.

00:14:55.020 --> 00:14:57.310
That makes it sound
even more fake.

00:14:57.480 --> 00:15:01.480
No! There is a scroll
which describes the event.

00:15:01.480 --> 00:15:03.150
Now where was it'?

00:15:03.150 --> 00:15:04.860
Oh, isn't that it?

00:15:06.570 --> 00:15:08.110
This sword bites!

00:15:08.740 --> 00:15:10.660
Don't be silly!

00:15:12.030 --> 00:15:14.330
Hey, when did I bite?

00:15:15.410 --> 00:15:17.160
This sword can speak!

00:15:17.330 --> 00:15:20.500
I am the one speaking.
Not Sounga.

00:15:20.500 --> 00:15:24.290
Oh! Only in our shrine could
such a treasured sword be found!

00:15:24.960 --> 00:15:25.840
Oh no...

00:15:25.840 --> 00:15:28.670
The 700-year-old seal
will be broken.

00:15:28.720 --> 00:15:29.510
What?!

00:15:29.630 --> 00:15:31.340
A 700-year-old seal?

00:15:31.840 --> 00:15:34.560
Sounga will be free of me.

00:15:34.850 --> 00:15:35.680
Hey!

00:15:35.680 --> 00:15:37.520
Is there a strong demon nearby?

00:15:37.680 --> 00:15:38.810
A demon'?

00:15:38.810 --> 00:15:40.600
Oh dear... What a bind I'm in!

00:15:40.600 --> 00:15:44.360
The Sounga is a terrible demon sword!
Terrible things will happen. . .!

00:15:49.860 --> 00:15:50.990
Hey, Sounga!

00:15:50.990 --> 00:15:52.360
Where are you going?!

00:15:52.870 --> 00:15:54.160
Wait! Hey!

00:15:55.620 --> 00:15:56.990
It went away.

00:15:57.660 --> 00:16:00.210
Our family treasure!

00:16:03.210 --> 00:16:05.880
- What's that?
- Looks like a sword?

00:16:05.880 --> 00:16:08.510
- A sword?
- But can a sword fly?!

00:16:10.470 --> 00:16:13.050
- Something's coming!
- Huh? Where, where?

00:16:13.050 --> 00:16:14.050
What's that?!

00:16:19.890 --> 00:16:20.890
What's that?!

00:16:21.060 --> 00:16:23.060
Man, it hurts...

00:16:23.060 --> 00:16:25.810
I said I'm sorry.
Now put the hat on.

00:16:26.320 --> 00:16:27.070
Huh?

00:16:29.690 --> 00:16:31.200
A strong demonic aura!

00:16:34.160 --> 00:16:34.910
Stand back!

00:16:37.120 --> 00:16:39.750
Finally, it's calmed down.

00:16:40.330 --> 00:16:41.540
What?

00:16:42.210 --> 00:16:44.250
Well, well!
If it isn't Tetsusaiga!

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:45.540
It's been a long time.

00:16:45.540 --> 00:16:46.460
What?

00:16:46.460 --> 00:16:48.920
Could you be Inuyasha?

00:16:50.510 --> 00:16:52.880
I don't know any swords!

00:16:53.260 --> 00:16:56.640
Well, I don't blame you
for not remembering.

00:16:57.050 --> 00:17:00.890
You were just a newborn back then.

00:17:01.980 --> 00:17:03.560
I am Saya.

00:17:03.560 --> 00:17:06.190
The sheathe of Sounga,

00:17:06.190 --> 00:17:10.150
the famous sword of Supreme Conquest
wielded by your father.

00:17:10.610 --> 00:17:11.780
My father?

00:17:12.320 --> 00:17:14.660
Oh no. . .
It's acting up again!

00:17:17.870 --> 00:17:20.450
<i>This sword...
I have a really bad feeling about it.</i>

00:17:21.290 --> 00:17:22.790
Hey, Inuyasha!

00:17:23.120 --> 00:17:25.080
Hurry and take hold of Sounga!

00:17:25.330 --> 00:17:27.830
Otherwise, terrible things will happen!

00:17:28.460 --> 00:17:30.960
I don't take orders from you!

00:17:33.220 --> 00:17:35.840
Oh, it's too late!

00:17:42.310 --> 00:17:43.730
It's freed itself!

00:18:12.000 --> 00:18:13.210
This is...

00:18:13.510 --> 00:18:14.630
What is this?

00:18:14.970 --> 00:18:17.180
Can the two of you see it?

00:18:18.840 --> 00:18:21.310
This is the future
of this land

00:18:21.310 --> 00:18:23.520
which Sounga will bring about.

00:18:24.520 --> 00:18:26.520
This is...the future'?

00:18:26.640 --> 00:18:29.400
Sounga's frightening power will

00:18:29.400 --> 00:18:32.770
make the skies dark and
cause the lands to decay.

00:18:32.770 --> 00:18:34.530
And people will die.

00:18:34.820 --> 00:18:36.700
What do we do
to prevent this from happening'?

00:18:37.030 --> 00:18:40.160
Take Sounga and
leave this land.

00:18:40.780 --> 00:18:43.870
However, a human
must not wield Sounga.

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:45.540
And if a human did take hold of it'?

00:18:45.870 --> 00:18:47.410
It will be the end
of this world.

00:18:48.500 --> 00:18:50.380
Anyone wielding the Sounga

00:18:50.380 --> 00:18:53.050
will continue killing until
every other human is killed,

00:18:53.050 --> 00:18:56.340
whether it takes
decades or centuries.

00:18:56.920 --> 00:19:00.680
Humans are more
egotistical and greedy

00:19:00.680 --> 00:19:02.300
than any other living creature.

00:19:03.310 --> 00:19:06.520
When a human possesses
the power of the Sounga,

00:19:06.520 --> 00:19:09.810
he becomes more evil
than any demon alive.

00:19:12.230 --> 00:19:15.400
Can't be helped. I'll put the sword
back in its sheathe.

00:19:15.690 --> 00:19:16.780
Inuyasha...

00:19:17.400 --> 00:19:18.490
Inuyasha!

00:19:54.110 --> 00:19:55.440
I'm so relieved!

00:19:59.030 --> 00:19:59.860
Here, your hat.

00:19:59.860 --> 00:20:00.780
Stay away!

00:20:13.630 --> 00:20:14.630
Inuyasha!

00:20:23.300 --> 00:20:24.090
Inuyasha. . .!

00:20:28.010 --> 00:20:30.480
What IS this sword anyway?!

00:20:32.390 --> 00:20:34.940
So you are his son'?

00:20:35.230 --> 00:20:37.940
Are you. . .Sounga?!

00:20:38.190 --> 00:20:43.320
And you think you are
strong enough to subdue me'?

00:20:44.280 --> 00:20:46.830
Obey me!

00:20:47.240 --> 00:20:51.460
And I shall make you
supreme ruler of these lands.

00:20:51.660 --> 00:20:53.210
Shaddup!

00:20:54.500 --> 00:20:57.000
I ain't interested in
such a thing!

00:21:05.220 --> 00:21:08.720
There's a better place
for you to be!

00:21:08.720 --> 00:21:10.850
I'll take you there!

00:21:12.350 --> 00:21:13.600
Inuyasha. . .!

00:21:15.520 --> 00:21:17.020
I'll go get rid of this!

00:21:17.190 --> 00:21:19.480
Get rid of it'?
How?

00:21:19.730 --> 00:21:21.280
It's my old man's sword!

00:21:21.990 --> 00:21:25.780
I should be able to
do something about it!

00:21:25.860 --> 00:21:26.620
<i>But...!</i>

00:21:27.030 --> 00:21:28.660
Don't follow me!

00:21:29.990 --> 00:21:31.370
I'm going, Kagome.

00:21:31.370 --> 00:21:32.200
Inuyasha!

00:21:38.750 --> 00:21:40.880
What a relief!

00:21:40.880 --> 00:21:44.340
It's a burden off my shoulders
and I can breathe easy.

00:21:44.420 --> 00:21:45.220
Stupid!

00:21:46.640 --> 00:21:48.260
Stupid Inuyasha!

00:21:48.800 --> 00:21:50.510
Acting so proud!

00:21:51.100 --> 00:21:54.390
Trying to do everything
by yourself!

00:21:55.100 --> 00:21:57.940
Why can't you
rely on me a bit more?!

00:22:06.200 --> 00:22:09.240
Hey... You're the sheathe
of that sword, aren't you?

00:22:09.450 --> 00:22:10.950
That I am...

00:22:11.370 --> 00:22:14.200
Then you can suppress
the power of the sword?

00:22:16.120 --> 00:22:18.420
Well, I wonder...

00:22:18.630 --> 00:22:20.250
You can, can't you?

00:22:21.630 --> 00:22:24.590
I can't say until I try...

00:22:24.920 --> 00:22:26.420
Then it's decided.

00:22:34.810 --> 00:22:35.810
What is that'?

00:22:36.230 --> 00:22:37.440
That's...

00:22:37.440 --> 00:22:39.230
It's coming from
the Bone Eater's Well.

00:22:39.770 --> 00:22:41.400
Th-That's ridiculous!

00:22:43.610 --> 00:22:45.150
Tenseiga?

00:22:46.320 --> 00:22:48.780
What's the matter, Lord Sesshomaru?

00:22:53.160 --> 00:22:55.330
<i>Lord Sesshomaru laughed!</i>

00:22:55.830 --> 00:22:58.160
<i>Something bad is
about to happen.</i>

00:23:05.090 --> 00:23:06.550
Is that you, Inuyasha?

00:23:07.630 --> 00:23:08.880
Shippo, get away!

00:23:10.640 --> 00:23:12.800
Get. . .away!

00:23:18.850 --> 00:23:20.900
Inuyasha, what's wrong with you?!

00:23:37.540 --> 00:23:39.500
Stop! Inuyasha!

00:23:41.330 --> 00:23:43.500
A demon! A demon is coming!

00:23:44.340 --> 00:23:45.170
What?!

00:23:45.170 --> 00:23:47.510
Everyone, run! A demon!

00:23:48.260 --> 00:23:49.300
Help!

00:23:53.550 --> 00:23:54.680
Help!

00:23:55.850 --> 00:23:57.220
- Inuyasha!
- Huh?!

00:24:09.820 --> 00:24:12.030
He's not the usual Inuyasha.

00:24:12.110 --> 00:24:13.780
Whatever happened to him?

00:24:17.200 --> 00:24:20.410
What's going on?! That's Sounga!

00:24:32.590 --> 00:24:35.220
Kill them! Kill them!

00:24:44.980 --> 00:24:47.230
Stop, Inuyasha!
Come back to your senses!

00:24:47.900 --> 00:24:50.570
What's wrong, Inuyasha?
Kill them!

00:24:50.570 --> 00:24:51.950
Kill them, I said.

00:24:55.120 --> 00:24:56.830
Snap out of it, Inuyasha!

00:24:57.410 --> 00:24:59.700
Do it! Kill them!

00:25:00.830 --> 00:25:04.250
Silence its noisy cries!
Do it!

00:25:05.460 --> 00:25:06.460
Stop!

00:25:12.920 --> 00:25:13.930
Why you-!

00:25:14.760 --> 00:25:15.590
Inuyasha!

00:25:15.890 --> 00:25:17.640
So you won't heed my words'?

00:25:20.270 --> 00:25:22.520
Kill them! Kill them!

00:25:26.400 --> 00:25:29.570
Miroku. .. Take them away quickly!

00:25:36.610 --> 00:25:39.620
- What's happened to Inuyasha'?
- I don't know.

00:25:39.620 --> 00:25:41.120
Something is wrong with him!

00:25:41.580 --> 00:25:42.290
Shippo!

00:25:45.000 --> 00:25:45.670
Inuyasha!

00:25:46.250 --> 00:25:48.670
Stay back! Get away from me!

00:25:48.670 --> 00:25:51.960
I'll send you all to hell!

00:25:53.920 --> 00:25:55.680
Oh no!
It's the Dragon Twister!

00:25:55.880 --> 00:25:57.680
Everyone, take to the skies!

00:26:03.100 --> 00:26:04.270
Kirara! Please go!

00:26:07.350 --> 00:26:09.190
Dragon Twister!

00:26:19.990 --> 00:26:21.240
How frightening!

00:26:21.450 --> 00:26:23.580
Such incomprehensible power!

00:26:23.750 --> 00:26:26.500
That was the Dragon Twister,
the attack of a dragon from hell!

00:26:26.830 --> 00:26:30.250
Its destructive power surpasses
even the Backlash Wave.

00:26:30.630 --> 00:26:32.420
We must stop Inuyasha quickly!

00:26:32.840 --> 00:26:35.090
If we approach him now,
we'll all be killed!

00:26:35.300 --> 00:26:36.470
Let's wait for Kagome.

00:26:36.670 --> 00:26:38.180
That's all we can do
at this point.

00:27:15.550 --> 00:27:17.380
It's quiet now.

00:27:17.720 --> 00:27:20.590
It used up its power
with that Dragon Twister.

00:27:21.510 --> 00:27:23.720
And now it needs to recoup, huh?

00:28:19.440 --> 00:28:20.200
'Morning!

00:28:20.450 --> 00:28:21.450
Kagome...

00:28:21.450 --> 00:28:22.950
Kagome!

00:28:26.950 --> 00:28:28.580
What happened here?

00:28:28.950 --> 00:28:31.870
Did Inuyasha use
the Dragon Twister?

00:28:32.250 --> 00:28:34.540
Wh-Who was it
that just spoke'?

00:28:34.630 --> 00:28:37.340
It was me!
Anything wrong with that'?

00:28:37.460 --> 00:28:40.050
Am I bothering you?

00:28:40.300 --> 00:28:43.470
He's awfully touchy, this guy.

00:28:44.260 --> 00:28:45.300
It's you, Saya!

00:28:45.300 --> 00:28:48.680
Why does Inuyasha
have the Sounga?

00:28:48.680 --> 00:28:52.310
It's been awhile, Myoga!
Still running away from things?

00:28:52.640 --> 00:28:53.980
Answer my question!

00:28:54.100 --> 00:28:56.150
Well, things have happened.

00:28:56.150 --> 00:28:57.820
You're the one who told me

00:28:57.820 --> 00:29:00.320
you'd take care of things
for about 700 years.

00:29:00.320 --> 00:29:02.150
You slacked off again, huh?!

00:29:02.360 --> 00:29:03.660
What're you saying?

00:29:03.660 --> 00:29:06.740
I kept strict guard
for 200 years without any sleep!

00:29:06.950 --> 00:29:08.660
The numbers don't add up!

00:29:08.990 --> 00:29:11.960
Umm. .. Maybe passing through
the Bone Eater's Well

00:29:11.960 --> 00:29:13.370
had something to do with it?

00:29:13.620 --> 00:29:15.250
The Bone Eater's Well?

00:29:16.750 --> 00:29:19.420
Oh, Kagome! You're back!

00:29:19.590 --> 00:29:20.590
Sango!

00:29:21.170 --> 00:29:22.670
Now we're all together.

00:29:23.170 --> 00:29:26.180
Let's follow the trail
of the Dragon Twister.

00:29:37.480 --> 00:29:40.530
Is it that sword
which awakened us?

00:29:40.530 --> 00:29:43.780
We have protected
this land for ages.

00:29:43.780 --> 00:29:45.410
This is an unforgivable act!

00:29:45.410 --> 00:29:49.160
Now, you shall taste the power
and wrath of the great Ogre tribe!

00:29:49.200 --> 00:29:50.370
Prepare to die!

00:30:02.010 --> 00:30:02.880
Dammit!

00:30:18.940 --> 00:30:20.570
Good, Inuyasha.

00:30:21.070 --> 00:30:26.240
Your heart is steadily trying
to become one with mine.

00:30:26.860 --> 00:30:29.950
Lord Sesshomaru!
Please wait!

00:30:30.070 --> 00:30:34.700
Lord Sesshomaru!
Where are you headed'?

00:30:37.080 --> 00:30:39.250
<i>Is it close, Tenseiga?</i>

00:30:39.670 --> 00:30:41.290
<i>But this scent...</i>

00:30:43.300 --> 00:30:44.420
Kagome, look!

00:30:44.760 --> 00:30:46.010
Dead ogre!

00:30:48.970 --> 00:30:50.300
I'll go take a look.

00:30:50.470 --> 00:30:52.430
You stay here, Kagome.

00:30:55.310 --> 00:30:56.810
I hope it's safe.

00:30:57.600 --> 00:31:00.150
It hasn't been long
since it died.

00:31:00.400 --> 00:31:02.520
I still sense
an evil aura close by.

00:31:05.070 --> 00:31:07.150
Is it Sounga's aura?

00:31:07.150 --> 00:31:09.110
Huh? Well...yes.

00:31:15.330 --> 00:31:16.910
It's supposed to be dead!

00:31:17.620 --> 00:31:18.790
I just remembered!

00:31:18.790 --> 00:31:24.300
Those slain by Sounga come back
as soul-less undead creatures!

00:31:24.300 --> 00:31:25.090
What?!

00:31:27.170 --> 00:31:28.130
Hiraikotsu!

00:31:35.140 --> 00:31:35.970
It's still alive!

00:31:37.430 --> 00:31:38.560
Wind Tunnel!

00:31:46.400 --> 00:31:47.320
Miroku!

00:31:48.900 --> 00:31:50.110
Are you all right?!

00:31:50.110 --> 00:31:52.870
Their corpses contain
potent miasma!

00:31:52.870 --> 00:31:54.490
You shouldn't take them in.

00:31:54.870 --> 00:31:57.660
I wish you'd said so sooner!

00:31:58.120 --> 00:31:59.290
What'll we do then?

00:31:59.620 --> 00:32:02.210
Fire! Burning them is the best way!

00:32:02.330 --> 00:32:04.290
That's my cue!

00:32:11.720 --> 00:32:12.640
Fox Fire!

00:32:16.760 --> 00:32:19.060
Not enough fire power at all.

00:32:22.520 --> 00:32:23.350
Kirara!

00:32:39.950 --> 00:32:40.910
Are you all right?

00:32:42.370 --> 00:32:43.210
Thank you!

00:32:51.050 --> 00:32:52.050
Miroku!

00:32:52.550 --> 00:32:53.380
Kagome!

00:32:53.550 --> 00:32:56.050
Never mind me.
Go and find Inuyasha!

00:32:56.390 --> 00:32:58.930
- But...
- I'll look after Miroku.

00:32:59.520 --> 00:33:02.770
If more of these appear,
we won't be able to handle them.

00:33:02.770 --> 00:33:04.230
All right, I understand.

00:33:31.420 --> 00:33:33.880
So it is you, Inuyasha.

00:33:36.260 --> 00:33:39.310
How did one like you
come to possess the Sounga?

00:33:39.810 --> 00:33:43.270
Don't tell me that another one of
Father's swords chose you?

00:33:43.480 --> 00:33:44.980
How would I know?!

00:33:44.980 --> 00:33:47.730
I'd gladly give this one to you...

00:33:48.610 --> 00:33:51.230
but it seems you're gonna
have to take it by force.

00:33:53.740 --> 00:33:55.200
I intended to anyway.

00:34:00.330 --> 00:34:01.490
Master Jaken...

00:34:01.620 --> 00:34:04.040
Lord Sesshomaru and Inuyasha
are siblings,

00:34:04.040 --> 00:34:05.790
but they really don't get along, do they?

00:34:06.120 --> 00:34:08.290
Must you state the obvious?!

00:34:09.250 --> 00:34:13.090
<i>But Lord Sesshomaru is very angry.</i>

00:34:13.460 --> 00:34:17.390
<i>Has Inuyasha's possession
of the sword upset him that much?</i>

00:34:17.970 --> 00:34:19.180
<i>But in retrospect,</i>

00:34:19.180 --> 00:34:22.390
<i>Lord Sesshomaru's father
was so heartless!</i>

00:34:22.390 --> 00:34:25.020
<i>Entrusting the powerful swords
only to Inuyasha...</i>

00:34:25.140 --> 00:34:29.520
<i>and leaving Lord Sesshomaru
the useless Tenseiga!</i>

00:34:41.490 --> 00:34:45.160
You are not fit to wield
the Sounga or the Tetsusaiga!

00:34:45.160 --> 00:34:48.710
The fact that Father's blood flows
through your veins is unforgivable.

00:34:49.500 --> 00:34:51.750
Who cares about that?!

00:34:55.170 --> 00:34:58.720
Sesshomaru, do you covet
the Sounga?

00:34:59.340 --> 00:35:03.510
When our blades clash,
I can read you completely.

00:35:03.680 --> 00:35:06.560
Even about Inuyasha
cutting off your left arm.

00:35:07.020 --> 00:35:09.520
Shut your damn mouth for a second!

00:35:20.320 --> 00:35:21.570
He must be there!

00:35:24.200 --> 00:35:26.000
Totosai!

00:35:26.290 --> 00:35:27.870
Oh, it's you, Kagome.

00:35:29.080 --> 00:35:31.380
Totosai, it's been awhile.

00:35:31.380 --> 00:35:34.000
Oh Saya, you're here too, eh?

00:35:34.210 --> 00:35:35.840
You're all acquaintances?

00:35:36.300 --> 00:35:39.220
Totosai, you must have
guessed already...

00:35:39.380 --> 00:35:43.760
I never thought that
Sounga would return...

00:35:43.890 --> 00:35:46.100
Inuyasha has it now.

00:35:46.220 --> 00:35:50.100
What? Inuyasha doesn't have
the power to control it.

00:35:50.230 --> 00:35:52.230
I had a suspicion about that...

00:35:52.230 --> 00:35:54.730
Why did you make
such a dangerous sword?

00:35:54.730 --> 00:35:56.360
That wasn't me.

00:35:56.360 --> 00:35:59.570
The Great Dog-Demon had it
from long ago.

00:35:59.570 --> 00:36:02.450
He's right.
Unlike Tetsusaiga and Tenseiga,

00:36:02.570 --> 00:36:06.240
Sounga is possessed by
the spirit of an ancient evil demon.

00:36:06.410 --> 00:36:08.580
With the Great Dog-Demon gone,

00:36:08.580 --> 00:36:12.960
the only one who can wield the Sounga
is probably Sesshomaru.

00:36:13.040 --> 00:36:14.750
Lord Sesshomaru!

00:36:22.760 --> 00:36:26.970
What's the matter, Inuyasha?
Can't win it alone?

00:36:27.100 --> 00:36:29.600
Then use my power!

00:36:42.110 --> 00:36:44.280
L-Lord Sesshomaru is
on the defensive!

00:36:46.120 --> 00:36:49.290
Two blood brothers killing each other...

00:36:49.410 --> 00:36:52.460
You two are just as foolish
as your father was.

00:36:52.670 --> 00:36:55.330
If he had heeded my words,

00:36:55.330 --> 00:36:59.880
he would not have met
such a miserable death.

00:36:59.960 --> 00:37:01.130
Silence!

00:37:20.530 --> 00:37:21.690
Amazing!

00:37:21.900 --> 00:37:23.990
You must hand it to
Lord Sesshomaru!

00:37:36.960 --> 00:37:38.500
<i>How can this be?</i>

00:37:38.670 --> 00:37:41.840
<i>I have never seen Lord Sesshomaru
brought to his knees!</i>

00:37:43.340 --> 00:37:45.010
Such a persistent one!

00:37:46.340 --> 00:37:47.300
Blood...

00:37:47.300 --> 00:37:48.680
Not enough blood.

00:37:48.720 --> 00:37:51.770
Give me a live sacrifice!

00:37:55.270 --> 00:37:56.310
He's coming!

00:37:57.190 --> 00:37:58.270
Stop!

00:38:01.690 --> 00:38:02.490
Don't come any closer!

00:38:08.200 --> 00:38:09.490
Sit, boy!

00:38:10.990 --> 00:38:12.200
What is this?!

00:38:13.620 --> 00:38:15.540
SIT, BOY!

00:38:21.170 --> 00:38:22.880
Damn wench!

00:38:29.390 --> 00:38:30.430
Master Jaken!

00:38:32.850 --> 00:38:34.100
Oh dear...

00:38:35.770 --> 00:38:40.980
Oh, it seems Sounga
has been driven off.

00:38:41.400 --> 00:38:43.570
Leave it to Kagome!

00:38:54.950 --> 00:38:57.580
Ohh! You're back to
your old self, Inuyasha!

00:38:57.790 --> 00:38:59.580
You are free of Sounga.

00:39:00.250 --> 00:39:01.920
It's all due to this girl.

00:39:02.000 --> 00:39:07.930
Inu...yasha... I came.
I'm sorry.

00:39:08.260 --> 00:39:09.470
Kagome!

00:39:09.800 --> 00:39:10.890
He)', Kagome!

00:39:11.760 --> 00:39:14.520
Dammit! That's why I told you
to stay away!

00:39:21.770 --> 00:39:22.730
Wait!

00:39:24.400 --> 00:39:28.700
I'll destroy the Sounga!
I don't want your interference!

00:39:29.450 --> 00:39:30.950
It is impossible for you.

00:39:31.280 --> 00:39:32.120
What?!

00:39:32.320 --> 00:39:34.330
Be grateful to that girl.

00:39:36.450 --> 00:39:39.540
Master Jaken, wake up!
Lord Sesshomaru is leaving!

00:39:40.920 --> 00:39:43.420
Master Inuyasha,
I'm so glad you are safe.

00:39:43.420 --> 00:39:45.090
- Myoga...
- Yes?

00:39:45.460 --> 00:39:47.670
What was my old man like?

00:39:48.050 --> 00:39:51.470
Well... He had tasty blood.

00:39:51.470 --> 00:39:54.930
Never mind that!
Was he strong?

00:39:55.180 --> 00:39:58.520
Well, he was a great demon, so...

00:39:59.390 --> 00:40:01.190
Was he stronger than I am right now?

00:40:01.190 --> 00:40:03.770
Well...

00:40:03.900 --> 00:40:04.900
'Fess up!

00:40:05.150 --> 00:40:09.150
The Great Dog-Demon was
a thousand times stronger.

00:40:09.240 --> 00:40:12.740
He never made the mistake of
allowing Sounga to control him.

00:40:14.830 --> 00:40:16.040
I see...

00:40:21.170 --> 00:40:22.330
Master Inuyasha!

00:40:22.330 --> 00:40:23.580
Take care of Kagome.

00:40:23.670 --> 00:40:26.630
Huh? Where do you
intend to go?

00:40:26.880 --> 00:40:28.380
Isn't it obvious?

00:40:29.630 --> 00:40:32.180
How can I let
Sounga get away?

00:40:32.840 --> 00:40:35.970
Well then, take Saya with you.

00:40:36.220 --> 00:40:39.850
Err... I really don't want to go...

00:40:44.230 --> 00:40:47.440
<i>Kagome, I can't involve you.</i>

00:40:49.070 --> 00:40:52.860
<i>I'll do something about
my old man's sword myself.</i>

00:40:56.740 --> 00:41:01.370
<i>Why did Father leave me,
not the Sounga nor Tetsusaiga...</i>

00:41:01.620 --> 00:41:04.540
<i>but the Tenseiga?</i>

00:41:33.700 --> 00:41:37.450
Not much of a body,
but better than nothing.

00:41:56.470 --> 00:41:59.470
With this, I can use
the Dragon Twister.

00:42:00.100 --> 00:42:04.850
I shall destroy both
the Tetsusaiga and the Tenseiga!

00:42:19.700 --> 00:42:22.870
Awaken, Takemaru of Setsuna!

00:42:23.120 --> 00:42:25.460
I am Sounga.

00:42:26.250 --> 00:42:28.080
<i>Sounga'?</i>

00:42:28.540 --> 00:42:31.090
Why do you call me
from the dead?

00:42:31.380 --> 00:42:36.300
I, Sounga, shall save
your wandering soul.

00:42:36.630 --> 00:42:38.890
Take revenge with me.

00:42:39.430 --> 00:42:42.010
Against the sons of
the one who killed you...

00:42:42.010 --> 00:42:45.140
take revenge against
Sesshomaru and Inuyasha.

00:42:45.310 --> 00:42:48.690
Unleash your pent-up grudge!

00:42:49.100 --> 00:42:50.150
Grudge?

00:42:50.480 --> 00:42:53.110
The woman who abandoned you...

00:42:54.360 --> 00:42:56.240
Izayoi

00:42:56.900 --> 00:42:59.820
You loved that woman.

00:43:02.120 --> 00:43:04.200
And he stole your woman.

00:43:04.500 --> 00:43:05.870
Hate him!

00:43:06.160 --> 00:43:07.580
Hate the woman!

00:43:08.000 --> 00:43:09.960
Hate his sons!

00:43:10.420 --> 00:43:15.340
Otherwise, your soul will
forever be chained here.

00:43:16.300 --> 00:43:18.470
Now, I call upon you!

00:43:18.680 --> 00:43:22.220
Let us take revenge
against his sons!

00:43:23.680 --> 00:43:24.850
Hate!

00:43:25.930 --> 00:43:30.310
I hate Inuyasha...and Sesshomaru!

00:43:30.310 --> 00:43:32.860
And I hate Izayoi!

00:43:42.700 --> 00:43:47.160
A sword which makes a man keep on
killing until the world is destroyed...

00:43:48.250 --> 00:43:52.380
In ages past, countless men sought
to be the supreme ruler of this world

00:43:52.380 --> 00:43:56.130
and searched for the Sounga,
stole it, and killed each other.

00:43:56.460 --> 00:43:59.720
The one who stopped
this senseless cycle...

00:44:00.050 --> 00:44:02.930
Was Inuyasha's father?

00:44:03.220 --> 00:44:04.260
Yes.

00:44:05.560 --> 00:44:07.930
Oh, Kagome, you're conscious!

00:44:09.520 --> 00:44:10.440
Where's Inuyasha?

00:44:11.980 --> 00:44:13.860
Where did Inuyasha go'?

00:44:14.230 --> 00:44:16.900
Hah! Who cares about Inuyasha!

00:44:17.070 --> 00:44:19.070
Why are you both here?

00:44:19.070 --> 00:44:23.530
Well... It's not that
Lord Sesshomaru left us...

00:44:24.410 --> 00:44:26.410
- He did, didn't he?
- Uh-huh.

00:44:27.540 --> 00:44:29.000
Don't say anything!

00:44:29.580 --> 00:44:32.750
I can't stay here!
I must catch up to Lord Sesshomaru!

00:44:32.830 --> 00:44:34.590
No, Master Jaken.

00:44:34.590 --> 00:44:36.880
We must thank Kagome properly.

00:44:38.630 --> 00:44:43.090
I didn't ask to be saved!
That girl acted willfully!

00:44:44.180 --> 00:44:45.100
Here!

00:44:46.680 --> 00:44:48.220
The enchanted beads...

00:44:48.350 --> 00:44:49.930
You gathered them?

00:44:50.350 --> 00:44:52.440
I'm not sure if they're all there.

00:44:52.810 --> 00:44:53.850
Thank you.

00:44:53.940 --> 00:44:57.820
No, I should thank you
for saving me.

00:45:01.360 --> 00:45:05.570
Can no one stop Inuyasha now?

00:45:09.620 --> 00:45:13.790
Stupid Inuyasha!
He's such a bother!

00:45:13.960 --> 00:45:16.250
It's all your fault, Saya!

00:45:16.880 --> 00:45:17.960
Saya!

00:45:19.090 --> 00:45:21.050
Huh? What?
What's the matter?

00:45:21.380 --> 00:45:25.300
You said you could seal the Sounga
for about 700 years.

00:45:25.760 --> 00:45:27.470
Did I'?

00:45:27.930 --> 00:45:31.480
But why was the Sounga
at our shrine?

00:45:32.230 --> 00:45:35.150
It can't be helped...
Let us tell you the tale.

00:45:35.480 --> 00:45:38.110
This goes back
about 200 years...

00:45:38.320 --> 00:45:41.650
when Inuyasha's father died.

00:45:45.490 --> 00:45:46.870
Master!

00:45:47.320 --> 00:45:49.120
Don't cry, Myoga-

00:45:49.490 --> 00:45:52.960
Crying won't bring back
the great Dog-Demon.

00:45:53.000 --> 00:45:55.170
I know that, but...

00:45:55.290 --> 00:45:59.420
By the way, did you take care of
the Tetsusaiga according to his will?

00:45:59.540 --> 00:46:00.840
Naturally!

00:46:00.840 --> 00:46:05.340
I sealed it behind the black pearl
together with the Master's body.

00:46:06.340 --> 00:46:10.060
And I made sure Tenseiga
was passed onto Sesshomaru.

00:46:10.470 --> 00:46:13.020
FOR SESSHOMARU

00:46:13.020 --> 00:46:15.100
Why would I do
such a dangerous thing?

00:46:15.100 --> 00:46:17.400
I want to live a long life!

00:46:18.520 --> 00:46:21.190
Which leaves this problem-
the Sounga.

00:46:22.030 --> 00:46:23.240
Saya...

00:46:23.400 --> 00:46:27.360
Are you sure Master didn't leave
any instructions for the Sounga?

00:46:27.490 --> 00:46:31.120
No, he only left instructions
for Tetsusaiga and Tenseiga.

00:46:31.370 --> 00:46:32.410
Oh dear...

00:46:32.410 --> 00:46:37.120
Knowing Master,
he must have good reason for this.

00:46:37.370 --> 00:46:40.130
But what a problem
he left us with.

00:46:42.170 --> 00:46:44.670
The Tetsusaiga which
their father wielded,

00:46:44.670 --> 00:46:46.760
along with the Tenseiga and Sounga

00:46:46.760 --> 00:46:48.890
were known as the three swords
of supreme conquest,

00:46:48.890 --> 00:46:51.890
with the power to dominate
the three worlds.

00:46:52.680 --> 00:46:53.430
Three worlds'?

00:46:53.890 --> 00:46:58.270
Heaven, Hell, and Earth
are the three worlds.

00:46:59.150 --> 00:47:02.730
Heaven, where the Buddha
and gods reside.

00:47:03.070 --> 00:47:06.070
Hell, the netherworld.
The world of the dead.

00:47:06.070 --> 00:47:10.240
EARTH HELL HEAVEN

00:47:11.280 --> 00:47:14.830
Each sword corresponded
to one world...

00:47:14.910 --> 00:47:18.460
Heaven's Tenseiga could save
a hundred lives in one sweep.

00:47:19.120 --> 00:47:21.670
Sounga of Hell could open
the gateway to the netherworld

00:47:21.670 --> 00:47:23.920
and summon a hundred dead souls
in one sweep.

00:47:24.760 --> 00:47:27.170
Tetsusaiga, the guardian of men,

00:47:27.170 --> 00:47:29.260
could fell a hundred enemies
in one sweep.

00:47:30.010 --> 00:47:33.350
And Inuyasha's father possessed
all three swords?

00:47:33.350 --> 00:47:34.600
So greedy!

00:47:34.770 --> 00:47:36.810
And then what happened?

00:47:37.140 --> 00:47:39.770
We couldn't think of
a good solution,

00:47:39.770 --> 00:47:41.610
and we were in a dilemma.

00:47:42.150 --> 00:47:46.070
How about letting
Sesshomaru have it?

00:47:46.070 --> 00:47:47.280
Don't be ridiculous!

00:47:47.280 --> 00:47:50.860
He's upset with us
over Tenseiga.

00:47:51.070 --> 00:47:53.330
If he finds us,
we'll all be killed.

00:47:53.580 --> 00:47:56.700
And Inuyasha is just an infant.

00:47:57.250 --> 00:47:59.710
If it's just to keep the Sounga quiet,

00:47:59.710 --> 00:48:02.460
I think I could hold on to it
for about 700 years.

00:48:03.460 --> 00:48:04.670
I guess I have no choice...

00:48:04.670 --> 00:48:08.630
Throw me into the Bone Eater's Well
in the land of Musashi.

00:48:08.800 --> 00:48:10.510
- Bone Eater's Well'?
- Bone Eater's Well'?

00:48:10.630 --> 00:48:14.100
I've heard that if a demon's corpse
is thrown into the well,

00:48:14.100 --> 00:48:16.640
it will disappear somewhere.

00:48:16.810 --> 00:48:18.600
That would work, wouldn't it?

00:48:19.850 --> 00:48:21.980
And that's how it
came to be at our shrine?

00:48:22.480 --> 00:48:25.860
Now although it's only been
200 years here,

00:48:25.860 --> 00:48:29.900
beyond the well,
it's been a good 700 years.

00:48:30.070 --> 00:48:33.740
Why is it that Kagome doesn't age
when she passes through the well?

00:48:33.870 --> 00:48:34.870
Well...

00:48:35.120 --> 00:48:38.660
It is the Bone Eater's Well
swirling with demonic aura.

00:48:38.870 --> 00:48:42.830
So Saya, is there a way to
defeat the Sounga'?

00:48:43.960 --> 00:48:45.130
Just one.

00:48:46.420 --> 00:48:48.420
With Tetsusaiga and Tenseiga.

00:48:48.630 --> 00:48:51.970
Pitted one on one,
Sounga will be stronger.

00:48:52.340 --> 00:48:57.260
But with the two swords combined,
it is possible to beat Sounga.

00:48:57.850 --> 00:48:59.810
Tetsusaiga and Tenseiga?

00:49:00.520 --> 00:49:03.230
If Inuyasha and Sesshomaru
join forces...

00:49:08.530 --> 00:49:12.110
Lord Sesshomaru join forces
with Inuyasha?!

00:49:12.110 --> 00:49:13.070
Are you crazy?!

00:49:13.160 --> 00:49:15.620
Hell will freeze over
before that happens!

00:49:15.700 --> 00:49:16.950
I agree with him.

00:49:17.030 --> 00:49:18.370
Same here.

00:49:18.490 --> 00:49:19.370
Me too.

00:49:19.870 --> 00:49:23.710
Saya, can't you seal the Sounga
one more time?

00:49:23.870 --> 00:49:25.630
Don't ask the impossible.

00:49:25.630 --> 00:49:29.000
I've hung in there for a thousand years,
and I'm exhausted.

00:49:29.050 --> 00:49:31.010
Wasn't it 200 hundred years?

00:49:31.010 --> 00:49:33.680
I've aged quite a lot.

00:49:34.300 --> 00:49:37.720
Kagome, don't be too hopeful
about that.

00:49:37.720 --> 00:49:40.810
Exactly! You can't rely on Saya.

00:49:41.220 --> 00:49:41.810
Huh?!

00:49:48.610 --> 00:49:51.070
Takemaru, use this...

00:49:51.570 --> 00:49:52.360
What is it'?

00:49:52.740 --> 00:49:54.990
Sesshomaru's left arm.

00:49:58.370 --> 00:50:01.580
With that arm, you can produce
the Dragon Twister.

00:50:02.330 --> 00:50:04.960
You will have no rival
in this universe.

00:50:04.960 --> 00:50:07.290
It will do you good
to test it.

00:50:27.770 --> 00:50:30.570
The path of the supreme conqueror
who knows no rival, huh?

00:50:44.290 --> 00:50:46.040
Rejoice, everyone!

00:50:46.120 --> 00:50:47.710
Our castle is in sight!

00:50:49.790 --> 00:50:52.300
We celebrate our triumphant
return tonight!

00:50:52.420 --> 00:50:54.300
Drink up and make merry!

00:51:01.850 --> 00:51:03.520
Huh? W-What is it'?

00:51:04.430 --> 00:51:06.230
Such a strange cloud movement.

00:51:06.350 --> 00:51:09.400
Hurry, men!
The rain is coming!

00:51:17.780 --> 00:51:18.860
Open the gate!

00:51:23.910 --> 00:51:25.040
What's going on?!

00:51:38.840 --> 00:51:40.090
Wh-Who are you?!

00:51:40.640 --> 00:51:43.260
I am called Takemaru of Setsuna.

00:51:44.680 --> 00:51:45.930
Men!

00:51:51.440 --> 00:51:53.690
Dragon Twister!

00:52:25.100 --> 00:52:29.520
This arm doesn't heed
my instructions too well.

00:52:41.240 --> 00:52:44.200
<i>What was the Sounga doing
in a place like this?</i>

00:52:56.920 --> 00:52:58.760
Takemaru of Setsuna...

00:52:59.510 --> 00:53:02.680
The Sounga chose that vermin'?

00:53:03.260 --> 00:53:04.390
You know him'?

00:53:06.930 --> 00:53:10.600
That's unusual.
This is a human burial site.

00:53:11.060 --> 00:53:13.810
Just what's your connection
to this?

00:53:14.560 --> 00:53:16.730
I have no connection
to that vermin.

00:53:16.940 --> 00:53:19.440
If there is a connection,
it is to you.

00:53:20.280 --> 00:53:21.110
Me?

00:53:21.440 --> 00:53:23.780
Humph. .. You probably aren't aware.

00:53:24.660 --> 00:53:26.320
You were born ignorant,

00:53:26.320 --> 00:53:28.950
and you live as
an ignorant half-demon.

00:53:30.830 --> 00:53:33.920
So then, you can die ignorant!

00:53:35.790 --> 00:53:38.210
Die and give me that Tetsusaiga!

00:53:40.130 --> 00:53:42.260
Well, it looks like
you've forgotten something!

00:53:42.420 --> 00:53:45.550
That Tetsusaiga's barrier rejects you!

00:53:45.890 --> 00:53:47.640
That may be so.

00:53:47.640 --> 00:53:50.270
But I'll have enough time
to kill that worm!

00:53:51.060 --> 00:53:54.640
I'll destroy the old man's sword!
You stay out of it!

00:53:54.850 --> 00:53:57.190
You don't even know
what Father looked like!

00:53:57.190 --> 00:53:58.610
So don't talk big!

00:54:06.490 --> 00:54:09.370
You merely received
Father's sword!

00:54:09.660 --> 00:54:11.490
Just what...

00:54:11.490 --> 00:54:12.910
can a half-demon like you do?!

00:54:18.130 --> 00:54:19.630
Sorry if I'm a half-demon!

00:54:20.040 --> 00:54:22.710
But seeing as I've beaten you
time and again,

00:54:22.710 --> 00:54:25.010
you're just a loser dog!

00:54:26.890 --> 00:54:28.180
Behold...

00:54:28.470 --> 00:54:30.140
Dragon Strike!

00:54:32.180 --> 00:54:34.060
I was expecting somethin' like that!

00:54:34.480 --> 00:54:36.520
Backlash Wave!

00:54:45.530 --> 00:54:49.870
<i>Sesshomaru,
why do you seek power?</i>

00:54:50.620 --> 00:54:51.740
<i>Father...</i>

00:54:52.040 --> 00:54:54.870
<i>I wanted to defeat you,
the one with supreme power.</i>

00:54:56.080 --> 00:54:57.750
<i>Yet you died...</i>

00:54:57.750 --> 00:55:01.290
<i>for the sake of a mortal woman
and Inuyasha.</i>

00:55:01.840 --> 00:55:06.090
<i>You, the one with the ultimate power...
the one I was supposed to beat!</i>

00:55:07.050 --> 00:55:10.970
<i>Inuyasha! You and your mother
caused his miserable death!</i>

00:55:13.520 --> 00:55:14.930
W-What?!

00:55:15.520 --> 00:55:17.600
My Backlash Wave. ...!

00:55:31.410 --> 00:55:34.410
This was as much as
the Tokijin could manage...

00:55:35.330 --> 00:55:37.540
I failed in killing him again.

00:55:52.010 --> 00:55:55.100
Sheathe... Did you protect me?

00:55:56.930 --> 00:56:00.980
Inuyasha never spoke
about his father.

00:56:01.770 --> 00:56:03.060
When I asked why,

00:56:03.060 --> 00:56:05.730
he'd say because he didn't even know
what his father looked like.

00:56:06.780 --> 00:56:11.870
But then, why is he so obsessed
with his father's sword?

00:56:12.200 --> 00:56:14.700
Why is he trying to resolve
everything all alone?

00:56:15.160 --> 00:56:17.950
That's how boys are.

00:56:18.450 --> 00:56:22.290
A boy's father is always at
the forefront of one's consciousness.

00:56:23.000 --> 00:56:25.800
How can I put it...?
It's very irritating.

00:56:27.210 --> 00:56:29.510
What your father can do,
you can do.

00:56:29.630 --> 00:56:31.970
And one day, you'll surpass him.

00:56:32.590 --> 00:56:36.470
For boys, a father is
a role model.

00:56:37.390 --> 00:56:40.600
Then if one's father is great,
that's tough.

00:56:41.100 --> 00:56:42.480
Well, I guess so.

00:56:42.810 --> 00:56:45.900
Hey! Keep your hands to yourself
when you talk!

00:56:46.070 --> 00:56:48.030
Oh, I got this habit
from my father.

00:56:48.030 --> 00:56:50.190
I must overcome it
someday, too.

00:56:52.240 --> 00:56:53.660
Forget it!

00:56:57.160 --> 00:56:58.290
When you think about it,

00:56:58.290 --> 00:57:00.290
Inuyasha's desire to get
the Sacred Jewel shards

00:57:00.290 --> 00:57:01.830
to become a full-fledged demon

00:57:01.830 --> 00:57:05.000
all boils down to his wish to
become a great demon like his father.

00:57:05.590 --> 00:57:08.920
You're right.
Though he's already strong enough.

00:57:09.300 --> 00:57:13.510
<i>Damn! I don't even "know what
Father looked like, " huh?</i>

00:57:14.050 --> 00:57:18.770
<i>You're lucky, Sesshomaru.
You know what the old man looked like.</i>

00:57:20.350 --> 00:57:23.770
<i>You've spoken with the old man.</i>

00:57:29.900 --> 00:57:32.200
Fallen soldiers all!

00:57:32.780 --> 00:57:35.110
Rise from the dead!

00:58:44.100 --> 00:58:49.110
Now come anytime!
Sesshomaru and Inuyasha!

00:58:53.280 --> 00:58:56.280
<i>I shall wield Father's Sounga
with this arm...</i>

00:58:57.110 --> 00:59:01.490
<i>At that moment, I shall have
the same power as Father.</i>

00:59:09.290 --> 00:59:13.840
Tetsusaiga, looks like
we're gonna be in a huge battle.

00:59:20.340 --> 00:59:22.970
That cloud...
What an ominous air...

00:59:23.260 --> 00:59:26.640
It seems as though that is
Sounga's citadel.

00:59:26.770 --> 00:59:27.770
Let's hurry!

00:59:28.480 --> 00:59:32.520
Kagome, are you
serious about going?

00:59:32.690 --> 00:59:33.980
Of course!

00:59:34.150 --> 00:59:37.610
But just what is
the meaning of this?

00:59:37.990 --> 00:59:38.820
Meaning?

00:59:38.990 --> 00:59:41.320
I understand Inuyasha's
involvement in this.

00:59:41.320 --> 00:59:44.830
But there's no reason
for you to fight.

00:59:45.200 --> 00:59:46.660
So why do you?

00:59:47.120 --> 00:59:48.920
Are you fond of fighting?

00:59:49.210 --> 00:59:50.580
I am not!

00:59:51.170 --> 00:59:54.880
I hate fighting, but I want to
stay by Inuyasha's side.

00:59:55.170 --> 00:59:56.630
That's all.

00:59:57.760 --> 00:59:59.010
Oh dear...

00:59:59.130 --> 01:00:02.970
No matter how old I get,
I will never understand humans.

01:00:03.100 --> 01:00:04.680
I completely agree.

01:00:04.760 --> 01:00:05.850
Same here.

01:00:09.060 --> 01:00:09.980
Forward!

01:00:24.410 --> 01:00:27.040
You are an interesting man...

01:00:28.000 --> 01:00:32.000
With Dragon Twister,
it would be over in a second.

01:00:32.250 --> 01:00:34.840
But then my hatred
will not subside.

01:00:34.840 --> 01:00:39.170
I want those two
to suffer to the fullest.

01:00:39.380 --> 01:00:40.760
Fine...

01:00:59.360 --> 01:01:02.410
So many of them.

01:01:02.740 --> 01:01:04.910
They're all dead soldiers...

01:01:05.240 --> 01:01:07.240
He's killed too many!

01:01:07.870 --> 01:01:11.750
That Sounga... He used
the Dragon Twister yet again.

01:01:12.250 --> 01:01:14.040
There are about 2000 enemy soldiers.

01:01:14.380 --> 01:01:17.420
Excluding Myoga, Rin and Momo
from fighting,

01:01:17.420 --> 01:01:18.960
there are eight of us
plus two demons.

01:01:20.380 --> 01:01:22.260
That's 200 soldiers for each of us.

01:01:22.800 --> 01:01:26.100
But how do we kill
the living dead'?

01:01:26.510 --> 01:01:30.430
If you weaken the demonic aura
around them, they can be destroyed.

01:01:30.470 --> 01:01:32.270
It will take time, though.

01:01:32.560 --> 01:01:33.940
Hey, Miroku...

01:01:34.100 --> 01:01:37.110
Why isn't a weak, little guy
like me excluded from fighting?

01:01:37.230 --> 01:01:41.070
What are you saying?
We're depending on you...

01:01:41.110 --> 01:01:42.820
and your Fox Fire.

01:01:43.110 --> 01:01:45.280
Oh...oh, I see!

01:01:45.450 --> 01:01:48.620
Jaken, fire works well against them!

01:01:49.240 --> 01:01:50.790
We're counting on you!

01:01:52.620 --> 01:01:55.710
I'll show them the power
of the Staff of Two Heads!

01:01:55.710 --> 01:01:57.540
You're trembling with fear!

01:01:57.540 --> 01:02:00.550
Silly! I'm trembling with excitement!

01:02:05.680 --> 01:02:06.550
Rain...

01:02:07.180 --> 01:02:09.060
Huh?!
Inuyasha!

01:02:39.460 --> 01:02:41.050
I have no business with you guys!

01:02:41.050 --> 01:02:42.090
Where's your leader?!

01:02:42.090 --> 01:02:45.630
Where's this Takemaru
who has the Sounga?!

01:02:59.940 --> 01:03:01.690
Go!

01:03:09.410 --> 01:03:12.790
Geez, I don't want to waste my strength
on something like this!

01:03:16.210 --> 01:03:18.710
Take this!
Staff of Two Heads!

01:03:18.790 --> 01:03:20.920
Go, Master Jaken!

01:03:21.380 --> 01:03:22.550
Hiraikotsu!

01:03:23.090 --> 01:03:23.800
Sacred Sutras!

01:03:27.630 --> 01:03:29.890
Take this!
Fox Fire!

01:03:35.180 --> 01:03:36.890
Aghh! It doesn't work too well!

01:03:38.310 --> 01:03:39.560
Move! Move!

01:03:41.810 --> 01:03:43.360
Outta my way!

01:03:54.910 --> 01:03:57.750
Even a demon's strength will weaken...

01:03:58.000 --> 01:03:59.290
And that moment...

01:03:59.960 --> 01:04:01.290
is the moment of victory!

01:04:21.100 --> 01:04:21.690
Damn!

01:04:29.280 --> 01:04:30.110
They're close.

01:04:32.280 --> 01:04:33.660
Dragon Strike!

01:04:36.290 --> 01:04:37.540
Is that Sesshomaru?

01:04:38.040 --> 01:04:41.370
Takemaru, destroy the Tenseiga.

01:04:41.460 --> 01:04:42.630
Understood.

01:04:43.130 --> 01:04:45.840
Shattering the Tenseiga
is a simple task.

01:04:50.800 --> 01:04:53.340
The fang of a weak demon...
That's all it is.

01:04:53.640 --> 01:04:54.760
Poison Claw!

01:04:55.970 --> 01:04:56.930
You're in the way!

01:05:07.570 --> 01:05:08.980
<i>Tenseiga...</i>

01:05:09.150 --> 01:05:11.820
<i>A sword I wouldn't miss
if I lost it, but...</i>

01:05:13.030 --> 01:05:14.160
<i>Father...</i>

01:05:19.910 --> 01:05:21.710
That's Lord Sesshomaru's. . .!

01:05:35.720 --> 01:05:37.180
What is this?

01:05:37.180 --> 01:05:39.140
You there, Rin!

01:05:39.430 --> 01:05:41.480
He wants the Tenseiga!

01:05:41.850 --> 01:05:44.520
No! This belongs to Lord Sesshomaru!

01:05:46.560 --> 01:05:47.980
Kagome!

01:05:48.190 --> 01:05:49.280
Kagome!

01:05:50.530 --> 01:05:51.570
Kagome!

01:05:52.780 --> 01:05:55.610
Help... Lord Sesshomaru!

01:05:58.160 --> 01:05:58.950
Kagome!

01:06:14.840 --> 01:06:15.680
Huh?

01:06:16.050 --> 01:06:16.890
Who is that'?

01:06:17.300 --> 01:06:21.810
Takemaru of Setsuna who fought
with Inuyasha's father 200 years ago.

01:06:22.930 --> 01:06:26.560
Hmm... You brought
something very interesting.

01:06:26.850 --> 01:06:31.110
Huh?! That Sounga
has possessed Takemaru!

01:06:31.280 --> 01:06:36.280
Takemaru. .. These young girls
are just like Izayoi.

01:06:36.360 --> 01:06:39.240
That Izayoi whom you killed.

01:06:40.120 --> 01:06:41.240
Izayoi?

01:06:41.620 --> 01:06:43.040
Who's Izayoi?

01:06:43.250 --> 01:06:45.000
Inuyasha's mother!

01:06:45.370 --> 01:06:48.250
Then he killed Inuyasha's mother?

01:06:48.830 --> 01:06:52.800
If you kill that girl,
how will Inuyasha react?

01:06:58.760 --> 01:07:01.010
Hey stop!
Don't come near!

01:07:02.930 --> 01:07:04.890
You are both Izayoi!

01:07:05.100 --> 01:07:10.360
Females who share an affinity
with demons are all Izayoi!

01:07:10.940 --> 01:07:13.940
<i>This guy... He's stark crazy!</i>

01:07:14.650 --> 01:07:15.990
Move, move!

01:07:26.160 --> 01:07:26.960
Sesshomaru!

01:07:27.290 --> 01:07:28.750
Useless fool!

01:07:28.750 --> 01:07:30.830
So what are you doing here?

01:07:30.830 --> 01:07:31.790
Shaddup!

01:07:36.670 --> 01:07:37.760
Sesshomaru!

01:07:37.760 --> 01:07:40.640
When this is over,
we'll settle things for good!

01:07:41.390 --> 01:07:43.760
If you live that long!

01:07:44.890 --> 01:07:48.020
You'd better not be killed
by anyone else!

01:07:55.530 --> 01:07:56.490
How's that?!

01:07:58.860 --> 01:08:00.110
Hold it!

01:08:01.240 --> 01:08:03.530
That's dirty, Sesshomaru!

01:08:13.420 --> 01:08:14.710
Come then!

01:08:15.170 --> 01:08:17.300
What're you going to do with that'?

01:08:17.380 --> 01:08:19.010
It can put up a barrier
or something, right?!

01:08:20.680 --> 01:08:23.140
A rusty old sheathe is useless.

01:08:23.140 --> 01:08:24.260
What?!

01:08:24.470 --> 01:08:25.430
Kagome!

01:08:28.680 --> 01:08:29.980
How dare you?!

01:08:30.140 --> 01:08:32.610
A man shouldn't hurt girls!

01:08:33.520 --> 01:08:35.980
Rin, run away...

01:08:35.980 --> 01:08:37.190
Don't worry!

01:08:37.190 --> 01:08:40.400
Lord Sesshomaru will
save us without fail!

01:08:41.030 --> 01:08:44.370
Resign yourselves and
go to the netherworld.

01:08:44.950 --> 01:08:45.700
<i>Rn“!</i>

01:08:45.950 --> 01:08:47.040
Die!

01:08:47.040 --> 01:08:48.370
<i>Lord Sesshomaru!</i>

01:08:56.250 --> 01:08:57.960
Lord Sesshomaru!

01:09:02.130 --> 01:09:05.470
Go! You'll only be
in my way!

01:09:05.890 --> 01:09:07.720
Let's go, Rin!

01:09:07.890 --> 01:09:09.980
Lord Sesshomaru! Here!

01:09:12.650 --> 01:09:13.650
Hurry and go.

01:09:14.190 --> 01:09:15.060
Yes.

01:09:26.410 --> 01:09:27.910
You're late.

01:09:29.910 --> 01:09:31.330
That left arm...

01:09:31.540 --> 01:09:35.750
Yes, it's yours.
Want it back?

01:09:36.500 --> 01:09:37.540
No thanks!

01:09:43.590 --> 01:09:44.430
Damn!

01:09:52.390 --> 01:09:56.310
Their bodies are imitations...
but their swords are real?!

01:09:57.980 --> 01:09:59.270
There's no end to this!

01:10:04.240 --> 01:10:05.360
Inuyasha!

01:10:05.820 --> 01:10:06.700
<i>You all...!</i>

01:10:20.090 --> 01:10:22.130
Aren't you exhausted, Inuyasha?!

01:10:23.920 --> 01:10:27.180
I didn't ask for help!

01:10:27.180 --> 01:10:29.300
Don't be so proud, Inuyasha!

01:10:29.470 --> 01:10:32.140
This is none of your business!

01:10:32.270 --> 01:10:34.640
Yeah, this is none of our business!

01:10:36.600 --> 01:10:39.480
But we're your friends!

01:10:44.240 --> 01:10:46.240
Heh, just do <i>as</i> you please!

01:10:50.200 --> 01:10:51.700
How does it feel?

01:10:51.700 --> 01:10:54.330
To be killed by your own hand?

01:10:55.000 --> 01:10:57.250
Is that all you were?

01:10:57.330 --> 01:10:58.250
What?

01:10:58.750 --> 01:11:01.710
You haven't noticed that
you're just Sounga's puppet.

01:11:02.210 --> 01:11:04.550
You actually believe that
it's your power...

01:11:04.670 --> 01:11:06.340
Such a miserable specter you are.

01:11:06.380 --> 01:11:07.470
Silence!

01:11:07.720 --> 01:11:11.050
You'll suffer the same humiliation
your father wrought upon me!

01:11:15.350 --> 01:11:16.100
What?!

01:11:21.690 --> 01:11:23.110
Be honored...

01:11:23.190 --> 01:11:25.990
You will be killed
with my father's fang!

01:11:26.740 --> 01:11:27.650
Hah!

01:11:31.070 --> 01:11:32.490
This way, Rin!

01:11:46.170 --> 01:11:47.260
Kagome!

01:11:55.390 --> 01:11:56.230
Kirara!

01:12:03.190 --> 01:12:04.190
I'm here!

01:12:15.240 --> 01:12:17.580
There're still so many!

01:12:19.330 --> 01:12:20.750
Everyone all right?

01:12:21.580 --> 01:12:23.710
I'm fine! I can manage...!

01:12:24.840 --> 01:12:25.880
Shippo!

01:12:27.210 --> 01:12:28.170
Kirara!

01:12:35.680 --> 01:12:37.310
Oh dear, this is troublesome.

01:12:41.940 --> 01:12:43.110
Sango!

01:12:46.110 --> 01:12:50.900
Inuyasha, leave this to us.
Hurry and go to Kagome!

01:12:51.110 --> 01:12:51.910
Miroku!

01:12:52.990 --> 01:12:54.780
I'll take care of the rest
with my Wind Tunnel.

01:12:55.280 --> 01:12:56.620
Now hurry!

01:12:57.080 --> 01:12:58.870
A-All right.

01:13:00.330 --> 01:13:01.460
Miroku!

01:13:03.170 --> 01:13:04.170
If you use the Wind Tunnel...

01:13:04.170 --> 01:13:06.630
You've all reached your limits.

01:13:06.800 --> 01:13:10.300
Besides, if I don't use it
for the woman I love...

01:13:10.630 --> 01:13:13.090
what good will it do to have this?

01:13:14.390 --> 01:13:15.600
Miroku...

01:13:16.050 --> 01:13:18.850
You two!
The enemy's right behind you!

01:13:21.690 --> 01:13:23.730
Now you living dead!

01:13:24.150 --> 01:13:25.690
Find peace!

01:13:25.940 --> 01:13:26.900
Wind Tunnel!

01:13:44.080 --> 01:13:46.170
Miroku... I owe you one!

01:13:55.180 --> 01:13:56.260
Miroku...

01:14:08.610 --> 01:14:09.400
Miroku!

01:14:11.230 --> 01:14:13.780
Hang on! Don't die!

01:14:21.120 --> 01:14:24.210
What can you do with
a sword that can't kill?!

01:14:24.960 --> 01:14:27.750
It can't kill humans,
but it can kill the living dead!

01:14:44.140 --> 01:14:47.520
What? Can't even kill a corpse?

01:14:48.900 --> 01:14:50.610
Release Kagome!

01:14:54.320 --> 01:14:55.320
Kagome!

01:14:58.160 --> 01:14:59.910
Thank you, Rin!

01:15:07.750 --> 01:15:09.040
That's no good!

01:15:11.250 --> 01:15:13.510
Oh! I keep missing.

01:15:13.880 --> 01:15:16.130
Move, you klutz!

01:15:25.770 --> 01:15:26.810
Inuyasha!

01:15:27.020 --> 01:15:30.270
I guess you can't
do without me, huh?

01:15:30.940 --> 01:15:32.820
Don't tell me
that was also "sports"?

01:15:33.070 --> 01:15:33.980
No, it wasn't.

01:15:35.150 --> 01:15:38.320
Umm... Lord Sesshomaru
is still up there...

01:15:38.780 --> 01:15:41.620
Damn him!
Showing off by himself!

01:15:41.620 --> 01:15:42.450
Wait!

01:15:43.160 --> 01:15:44.200
Don't stop me!

01:15:44.490 --> 01:15:47.580
I have to settle things
with Sounga!

01:15:47.580 --> 01:15:48.870
So listen to me!

01:15:48.870 --> 01:15:50.290
What is it'?

01:15:50.290 --> 01:15:52.040
In order to destroy Sounga,

01:15:52.040 --> 01:15:56.970
Tetsusaiga and Tenseiga have to
combine forces and work together!

01:15:57.170 --> 01:15:58.220
Exactly!

01:15:58.470 --> 01:15:59.630
What?!

01:15:59.800 --> 01:16:03.810
You must combine your Backlash Wave
with Sesshomaru's Dragon Strike,

01:16:03.930 --> 01:16:07.060
in order to defeat
Sounga's Dragon Twister.

01:16:08.140 --> 01:16:12.020
Hah! No way will Sesshomaru
cooperate with me!

01:16:12.360 --> 01:16:13.150
Stupid!

01:16:13.320 --> 01:16:15.900
You have to cooperate
with Sesshomaru!

01:16:16.150 --> 01:16:17.650
I ain't gonna do that!

01:16:17.860 --> 01:16:19.650
There's no other way!

01:16:19.860 --> 01:16:22.990
You're brothers! Defer to him
just this once!

01:16:24.370 --> 01:16:25.330
Try it!

01:16:25.700 --> 01:16:27.370
You can do it, Inuyasha!

01:16:27.950 --> 01:16:30.170
You've managed every time
until now.

01:16:32.830 --> 01:16:35.130
Hah! Like it's so easy to do!

01:16:42.220 --> 01:16:43.180
What's the matter?

01:16:44.760 --> 01:16:46.430
The enchanted beads...

01:16:48.020 --> 01:16:50.850
<i>We're still connected, aren't we?</i>

01:16:54.020 --> 01:16:55.690
What's wrong, Sesshomaru?

01:16:57.150 --> 01:16:59.320
Your father's fang is crying!

01:17:05.620 --> 01:17:07.910
<i>Do you have someone
to protect?</i>

01:17:09.200 --> 01:17:10.160
<i>Father...</i>

01:17:28.600 --> 01:17:31.810
Your nose is sharp as ever.

01:17:32.390 --> 01:17:35.230
You picked up the scent
of my Wind Scar, huh?

01:17:35.520 --> 01:17:38.820
Your wind is no more
than a gentle breeze.

01:17:39.030 --> 01:17:42.700
Heh, I was hoping to
take you both out at the same time!

01:17:43.160 --> 01:17:46.490
Two brothers working together
to avenge their father, huh?

01:17:46.580 --> 01:17:49.660
So even demons have feelings?

01:17:49.830 --> 01:17:52.750
Who the hell are you to talk?!

01:17:54.790 --> 01:17:58.300
Looking at you
reminds me of Izayoi.

01:17:58.300 --> 01:17:59.000
Huh?!

01:17:59.000 --> 01:18:04.260
A foolish woman who abandoned me and
gave birth to a half-breed like you...

01:18:04.840 --> 01:18:05.890
Why you-!

01:18:05.890 --> 01:18:07.510
Listen well, Inuyasha...

01:18:08.180 --> 01:18:12.560
I am the man who sent your mother
to the netherworld.

01:18:18.060 --> 01:18:18.940
Move!

01:18:19.270 --> 01:18:20.360
Get back!

01:18:20.360 --> 01:18:21.280
Shaddup!

01:18:21.280 --> 01:18:23.280
You're not going to
one up me this time!

01:18:23.450 --> 01:18:27.370
This is the perfect opportunity
to kill you both at the same time!

01:18:27.780 --> 01:18:30.450
Takemaru, use the Dragon Twister.

01:18:30.580 --> 01:18:33.120
Destroy the Tetsusaiga
and Tenseiga.

01:18:33.250 --> 01:18:35.790
I don't need you
to tell me that!

01:18:38.170 --> 01:18:39.630
Like I'd let you!

01:18:39.630 --> 01:18:41.460
You don't know when
to give up, do you?!

01:18:45.470 --> 01:18:48.140
I just don't like to give up!

01:18:51.260 --> 01:18:52.810
Huh?! impossible...!

01:18:53.730 --> 01:18:57.690
Why you-!
You still have such power...

01:18:58.150 --> 01:19:00.650
This is nothing
to be surprised about!

01:19:02.650 --> 01:19:04.990
It's inconceivable in a demon!

01:19:05.150 --> 01:19:08.070
Damn right! I'm a half-demon!

01:19:08.740 --> 01:19:12.450
More egotistical and greedy
than any other living creature...

01:19:12.450 --> 01:19:14.080
That's a human being, right'?

01:19:14.500 --> 01:19:16.830
Well, human blood flows
through my veins

01:19:16.830 --> 01:19:18.710
and that's why I just won't give up!

01:19:19.000 --> 01:19:20.000
On top of that...

01:19:20.000 --> 01:19:22.880
when a human has someone
he has to protect,

01:19:22.880 --> 01:19:25.510
his power increases multifold.

01:19:27.300 --> 01:19:29.340
That's why I'm able to destroy you now!

01:19:29.340 --> 01:19:31.850
I owe it to my mother!

01:19:33.270 --> 01:19:34.680
<i>Takemaru...</i>

01:19:36.480 --> 01:19:37.520
Izayoi...

01:19:49.700 --> 01:19:52.120
<i>Hurry and leave immediately.</i>

01:19:57.790 --> 01:20:01.330
<i>Hurry and leave
with the men outside.</i>

01:20:02.000 --> 01:20:05.050
Lady Izayoi. . .
You...

01:20:05.130 --> 01:20:08.430
<i>I do not want you to die.</i>

01:20:09.220 --> 01:20:11.390
You tried to protect me...

01:20:11.890 --> 01:20:15.470
Takemaru. . .?
What's wrong, Takemaru?

01:20:16.060 --> 01:20:17.350
I remember...

01:20:18.560 --> 01:20:22.730
I never resented Lady Izayoi.

01:20:23.440 --> 01:20:27.440
I always. . .loved. . .Lady Izayoi...

01:20:34.240 --> 01:20:35.450
It's over.

01:20:47.300 --> 01:20:49.920
Hah! I don't know
what you're up to,

01:20:49.920 --> 01:20:52.590
but I'm the one who beat him!

01:20:52.760 --> 01:20:54.600
It's not over yet.

01:20:54.760 --> 01:20:55.600
Huh?!

01:20:59.640 --> 01:21:00.980
Persistent bastard!

01:21:18.410 --> 01:21:22.330
I shall open the path
to the underworld!

01:21:48.230 --> 01:21:52.110
Oh no! Sounga has opened
the gateway to Hell!

01:21:52.110 --> 01:21:53.570
What happens
when it's open?

01:21:53.820 --> 01:21:57.160
The boundary between
the living and the dead disappears.

01:21:57.160 --> 01:21:59.450
We'll all end up dead.

01:21:59.700 --> 01:22:00.660
Oh no...!

01:22:00.660 --> 01:22:03.960
After all, it's the sword
that controls Hell.

01:22:04.460 --> 01:22:07.670
While Tetsusaiga and Tenseiga
exchange blows,

01:22:07.670 --> 01:22:11.510
Sounga is trying to absorb
this world into Hell.

01:22:13.010 --> 01:22:15.300
Fool! Don't go near there!

01:22:30.320 --> 01:22:31.610
What is that?!

01:22:31.990 --> 01:22:34.240
The dead of the underworld.

01:22:34.240 --> 01:22:37.820
They're calling out
to the souls of the living.

01:22:38.240 --> 01:22:42.370
We must hurry and run away,
or your souls will be swallowed up!

01:22:42.660 --> 01:22:45.000
But Inuyasha and Sesshomaru are still...

01:22:45.250 --> 01:22:46.500
Here it comes!

01:22:55.470 --> 01:22:57.180
They cause so much trouble!

01:22:58.390 --> 01:22:59.430
What is this?

01:22:59.600 --> 01:23:02.020
This feeling deep in my heart?

01:23:09.520 --> 01:23:12.320
Sango, you must be strong.

01:23:12.530 --> 01:23:14.400
Do not let your heart
be devoured by the darkness!

01:23:17.110 --> 01:23:19.660
Everyone! Gather round me!

01:23:26.960 --> 01:23:28.920
It's so cold, Master Jaken!

01:23:29.250 --> 01:23:31.590
Hey, Saya! Can't you do something?!

01:23:31.960 --> 01:23:34.340
With my power, this is the limit.

01:23:34.340 --> 01:23:36.420
But if you leave my barrier,

01:23:36.420 --> 01:23:40.220
all the humans will be
taken over by the dead.

01:23:40.600 --> 01:23:45.270
<i>No way! If anything happens to Rin,
I'll be killed by Lord Sesshomaru!</i>

01:23:46.100 --> 01:23:47.940
Huh?! Lord Sesshomaru!

01:23:49.400 --> 01:23:50.230
Move!

01:23:51.310 --> 01:23:52.230
You're in my way!

01:23:55.360 --> 01:23:57.400
You're such a disappointment.

01:23:58.490 --> 01:24:01.320
A vulgar sword deserves
a cast-off arm.

01:24:05.950 --> 01:24:09.330
You can't wield the Sounga!

01:24:09.460 --> 01:24:10.920
Move!

01:24:11.830 --> 01:24:14.300
I'll be the one to destroy you!

01:24:14.710 --> 01:24:15.760
That won't work!

01:24:15.760 --> 01:24:18.800
You can't attack him separately!

01:24:21.640 --> 01:24:22.970
Kagome! Where are you going?!

01:24:40.820 --> 01:24:41.820
Inuyasha!

01:24:42.370 --> 01:24:43.240
Kagome!

01:24:43.830 --> 01:24:46.580
Please fight together with Sesshomaru!

01:24:46.950 --> 01:24:48.870
No way!

01:24:49.120 --> 01:24:52.460
Sesshomaru! Please cooperate
with Inuyasha!

01:24:52.460 --> 01:24:53.250
What-?!

01:24:53.250 --> 01:24:55.340
Are you listening, Sesshomaru?!

01:24:56.420 --> 01:24:58.260
Yes, Lord Sesshomaru!

01:24:58.340 --> 01:25:02.260
There's no need for you to ally yourself
with a half-demon like Inuyasha!

01:25:07.180 --> 01:25:11.770
Lord Sesshomaru...
Please join forces with Inuyasha.

01:25:14.020 --> 01:25:15.190
Move!

01:25:16.110 --> 01:25:19.570
I give up on both of you nincompoops!

01:25:23.780 --> 01:25:24.530
NOW!

01:25:25.240 --> 01:25:25.990
Why you-!

01:25:28.660 --> 01:25:29.540
Kagome!

01:25:32.620 --> 01:25:33.630
Kagome!

01:25:39.170 --> 01:25:40.210
Hold this!

01:25:40.340 --> 01:25:42.380
It'll protect you
for a little while.

01:25:53.900 --> 01:25:55.060
W-What's happening?!

01:25:55.400 --> 01:25:57.070
The hole is expanding!

01:25:57.070 --> 01:25:58.480
It's dangerous here, too!

01:25:58.860 --> 01:26:00.650
But Kagome and Inuyasha are. ...!

01:26:05.910 --> 01:26:07.330
It's useless...

01:26:09.080 --> 01:26:10.700
Dragon Twister!

01:26:12.660 --> 01:26:13.330
What?!

01:26:15.420 --> 01:26:16.170
Inuyasha!

01:26:17.290 --> 01:26:18.210
Inuyasha!

01:26:19.050 --> 01:26:19.880
Dammit!

01:26:25.300 --> 01:26:27.100
Backlash Wave!

01:26:30.970 --> 01:26:33.270
You're not bad.
This is entertaining!

01:26:33.350 --> 01:26:35.230
Damn! I missed!

01:26:36.440 --> 01:26:37.150
Inuyasha!

01:26:37.520 --> 01:26:39.980
Wait here!
I'll be back without fail!

01:26:41.280 --> 01:26:42.030
All right.

01:26:46.450 --> 01:26:48.570
Kid, how's this?

01:26:53.750 --> 01:26:55.120
Backlash Wave!

01:26:57.960 --> 01:26:59.290
My Backlash Wave isn't working!

01:27:04.590 --> 01:27:05.720
Inuyasha. . .!

01:27:09.390 --> 01:27:12.930
<i>Even Lord Sesshomaru is
at a disadvantage when empty-handed.</i>

01:27:13.140 --> 01:27:15.850
Was that the limit of
Dragon Twister's power?

01:27:15.980 --> 01:27:19.020
Tenseiga and Tetsusaiga
are nearby.

01:27:19.020 --> 01:27:22.610
So Sounga can't utilize
its full power.

01:27:26.780 --> 01:27:27.820
Inuyasha!

01:27:34.250 --> 01:27:35.000
Take this!

01:27:35.460 --> 01:27:38.000
I'll send you both to Hell!

01:27:38.460 --> 01:27:39.580
You're in the way!

01:27:41.000 --> 01:27:42.130
Lord Sesshomaru!

01:27:56.310 --> 01:27:58.520
Lord Sesshomaru, you are safe!

01:27:58.770 --> 01:28:02.230
He protected himself at the last second
with Tenseiga's barrier.

01:28:02.230 --> 01:28:05.690
Hey Myoga, weren't you with Kagome?

01:28:07.530 --> 01:28:09.360
Err... Well...

01:28:09.530 --> 01:28:13.870
It seemed to me that Sesshomaru
also protected Inuyasha.

01:28:14.040 --> 01:28:14.700
Yes...

01:28:23.210 --> 01:28:24.960
I can't produce the Backlash Wave!

01:28:33.720 --> 01:28:34.890
Inuyasha!

01:28:44.070 --> 01:28:47.030
Now do you realize
how weak you are, half-demon'?

01:28:47.240 --> 01:28:50.070
Sesshomaru! It is your turn next!

01:28:52.450 --> 01:28:53.910
It ain't over yet!

01:28:56.910 --> 01:28:58.080
Like...

01:28:58.410 --> 01:28:59.580
I said...

01:29:00.250 --> 01:29:02.460
with human blood
flowing through my veins...

01:29:02.580 --> 01:29:04.670
I don't give up!

01:29:12.090 --> 01:29:15.140
Then this time, I shall
deliver the final blow!

01:29:15.220 --> 01:29:18.930
Fall to Hell with the mortal girl!

01:29:19.810 --> 01:29:21.020
Come at me!

01:29:21.020 --> 01:29:23.810
I'll counter your attack
with my Backlash Wave!

01:29:30.400 --> 01:29:31.780
Dragon Twister!

01:29:33.990 --> 01:29:37.450
Go! Backlash Wave!

01:29:40.870 --> 01:29:44.210
Fool! As if you can win
with just the Tetsusaiga!

01:29:44.420 --> 01:29:46.670
Try <i>as</i> you may to stop me!

01:29:46.670 --> 01:29:49.630
But the world of mortals will be
swallowed up by the netherworld!

01:29:50.550 --> 01:29:52.300
Shut your mouth!

01:29:54.720 --> 01:29:56.760
I have someone to protect!

01:29:59.140 --> 01:30:01.060
That's why I can't give up!

01:30:05.480 --> 01:30:06.690
Tenseiga?

01:30:07.690 --> 01:30:10.110
<i>Have you someone to protect?</i>

01:30:12.610 --> 01:30:17.740
<i>Lord Sesshomaru!</i>

01:30:17.990 --> 01:30:21.620
<i>Lord Sesshomaru!</i>

01:30:22.540 --> 01:30:24.750
<i>Have you someone to protect?</i>

01:30:27.380 --> 01:30:28.840
Someone to protect?

01:30:36.220 --> 01:30:40.510
I, Sesshomaru,
have no one to protect!

01:30:43.520 --> 01:30:44.390
What?!

01:31:09.210 --> 01:31:09.920
Did we get him?!

01:31:18.590 --> 01:31:20.220
The cloud is being
swallowed up!

01:31:33.570 --> 01:31:34.400
Kagome!

01:31:40.830 --> 01:31:43.580
- Lord Sesshomaru!
- Lord Sesshomaru!

01:31:55.920 --> 01:31:57.590
Kagome! Inuyasha!

01:31:57.680 --> 01:31:59.010
You're both okay!

01:31:59.010 --> 01:32:00.430
'Course!

01:32:00.800 --> 01:32:02.180
Inuyasha, look!

01:32:04.560 --> 01:32:06.100
That's the Sounga!

01:32:29.370 --> 01:32:30.290
<i>Father...</i>

01:32:37.970 --> 01:32:39.340
- Master!
- Master!

01:32:40.300 --> 01:32:41.470
What! Father'?

01:32:42.300 --> 01:32:43.220
Then that's-?!

01:32:46.310 --> 01:32:49.230
Sesshomaru. . .Inuyasha...

01:32:50.140 --> 01:32:53.110
You finally found the answer.

01:32:53.400 --> 01:32:57.360
With this, Sounga has been
sealed forever in the netherworld.

01:32:57.690 --> 01:33:00.610
There is nothing more
to say to you.

01:33:02.240 --> 01:33:03.160
Old man!

01:33:07.870 --> 01:33:09.250
<i>Father...</i>

01:33:11.000 --> 01:33:16.500
The Master believed in his sons
and left everything in their hands.

01:33:16.670 --> 01:33:17.710
What do you mean?

01:33:17.710 --> 01:33:21.090
The only chance to seal
Sounga, the sword of calamity,

01:33:21.090 --> 01:33:26.010
was the moment
the gateway to Hell opened.

01:33:26.140 --> 01:33:27.680
And that only became possible

01:33:27.680 --> 01:33:32.310
when Tenseiga and Tetsusaiga
combined their powers.

01:33:32.600 --> 01:33:36.020
The Master hoped that
this would happen.

01:33:36.320 --> 01:33:39.110
Hah! The nerve of him!

01:33:40.280 --> 01:33:41.280
Ridiculous!

01:33:43.360 --> 01:33:46.870
- Wait, Lord Sesshomaru!
- Wait, Lord Sesshomaru!

01:33:48.450 --> 01:33:52.080
Saya! If you heard
the Master's last wishes,

01:33:52.080 --> 01:33:54.290
why didn't you speak up earlier?!

01:33:54.290 --> 01:33:57.380
Well, I was just thinking
of those two...

01:33:57.710 --> 01:33:59.380
Hah! I'll bet you forgot!

01:33:59.380 --> 01:34:00.460
Well...

01:34:00.880 --> 01:34:03.590
Such lovable old men.

01:34:06.350 --> 01:34:09.310
Your father seemed like a kind man.

01:34:09.850 --> 01:34:10.850
Think so?

01:34:11.100 --> 01:34:12.730
Are you happy
you got to meet him'?

01:34:13.060 --> 01:34:14.020
Not really.

01:34:14.560 --> 01:34:18.020
Wasn't there something
you wanted to say to your father?

01:34:18.270 --> 01:34:20.070
Nope. Not at all.

01:34:21.740 --> 01:34:22.950
So proud!

01:34:23.320 --> 01:34:24.530
What?

01:34:24.530 --> 01:34:25.870
Oh look, larks!

01:37:34.260 --> 01:37:35.800
Say, Inuyasha...

01:37:36.010 --> 01:37:37.060
Huh?

01:37:37.720 --> 01:37:40.890
I thought that Sesshomaru
didn't like people,

01:37:40.890 --> 01:37:42.270
but maybe it's not so.

01:37:42.850 --> 01:37:44.440
I'm sure he hates them.

01:37:44.940 --> 01:37:47.860
But Rin is by his side
all the time.

01:37:48.190 --> 01:37:49.780
Who <i>cares</i> about that'?

01:37:50.280 --> 01:37:53.450
Oh yes! Inuyasha, sit up!
C'mon, sit up!

01:37:53.530 --> 01:37:54.620
What?

01:37:55.320 --> 01:37:56.950
I have something nice for you.

01:37:57.870 --> 01:37:59.370
What a pain...

01:37:59.700 --> 01:38:02.120
Please, close your eyes.

01:38:02.660 --> 01:38:03.540
Geez...

01:38:06.960 --> 01:38:07.840
Okay, open.

01:38:08.460 --> 01:38:09.300
Huh?

01:38:10.130 --> 01:38:12.130
Arghh! What is this?

01:38:12.130 --> 01:38:13.930
Not the Beads of
Subjugation again!

01:38:14.640 --> 01:38:16.720
You said something nice!

01:38:16.720 --> 01:38:19.350
You were thinking of
something nasty!

01:38:19.640 --> 01:38:21.140
L-Like what?!

01:38:21.140 --> 01:38:21.980
I knew it!

01:38:22.390 --> 01:38:26.610
I don't need this thing!
Don't you trust me?

01:38:26.810 --> 01:38:28.070
Sure I trust you.

01:38:28.320 --> 01:38:30.820
But I don't want you
going off alone again.

01:38:31.440 --> 01:38:34.410
I won't!
Hey! Take it off!

01:38:34.410 --> 01:38:35.280
Nope.

01:38:35.820 --> 01:38:37.410
Take it off!

01:38:37.410 --> 01:38:38.410
Sit, boy.
